{"3370980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bearplane", "steam_appid": 3370980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a rocket-powered bear in <i>Bearplane</i>—a whimsical, action-packed adventure loosely inspired by the legendary tale of Wojtek, the bear who served alongside the Polish army in World War II. Command this fearless furball as he battles dastardly foes with outrageous abilities, explosive power-ups, and a whole lot of midair mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ram! Roast! Roar! Victory awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain down righteous justice from above! Ram enemy aircraft into scrap metal, roast bad guys mid-flight with blazing jet flames, or belt out a sky-shaking roar that ejects foes straight from their cockpits. The skies won’t know what hit ’em.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suit up, power up, and look sharp!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero needs an arsenal... and flair! Equip bazookas, jousting lances, and other wild weapons of sky-bound destruction. Then top it all off with a tactical hat built for glory. Some hats supercharge your firepower, others give you the edge in snow, rain, or stormy skies. The right loadout turns you into a flying fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the makers of the world’s first atomic breakfast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble Flappy Flakes, chug Nukey Nectar, and pop open a bottle of Honey Thunder Cola. These top-secret “nutritional breakthroughs” supercharge your mission with flapping flight, blistering speed, and brute strength. Side effects may include total domination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and enlist a co-pilot! Player 2 joins the ranks as Rifle Rat, your brave, gun-toting sidekick. Join forces, double your firepower, and deliver freedom—one explosion at a time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a rocket-powered bear in <i>Bearplane</i>—a whimsical, action-packed adventure loosely inspired by the legendary tale of Wojtek, the bear who served alongside the Polish army in World War II. Command this fearless furball as he battles dastardly foes with outrageous abilities, explosive power-ups, and a whole lot of midair mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ram! Roast! Roar! Victory awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain down righteous justice from above! Ram enemy aircraft into scrap metal, roast bad guys mid-flight with blazing jet flames, or belt out a sky-shaking roar that ejects foes straight from their cockpits. The skies won’t know what hit ’em.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suit up, power up, and look sharp!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero needs an arsenal... and flair! Equip bazookas, jousting lances, and other wild weapons of sky-bound destruction. Then top it all off with a tactical hat built for glory. Some hats supercharge your firepower, others give you the edge in snow, rain, or stormy skies. The right loadout turns you into a flying fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the makers of the world’s first atomic breakfast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble Flappy Flakes, chug Nukey Nectar, and pop open a bottle of Honey Thunder Cola. These top-secret “nutritional breakthroughs” supercharge your mission with flapping flight, blistering speed, and brute strength. Side effects may include total domination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and enlist a co-pilot! Player 2 joins the ranks as Rifle Rat, your brave, gun-toting sidekick. Join forces, double your firepower, and deliver freedom—one explosion at a time.</p>", "short_description": "Blast off as a rocket-powered bear in this hand-drawn 2D arcade shooter! Ram enemy planes, roast villains with jet flames, and roar them out of the sky. Unlock flair-packed hats, snack on atomic power-ups, and team up with Rifle Rat for couch co-op chaos!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/55a5fedbcffe52f8b6238e4a245cd7b49bfb41ff/header.jpg?t=1756383715", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/9a51217cb98b9813622871606bec3932987201a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756383715", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/9a51217cb98b9813622871606bec3932987201a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756383715", "website": "https://atomicmills.com/bearplane", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 @ 3.1 GHz (or AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 740 / AMD Radeon HD 5670<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Built for Steam Deck! Supports both gamepad and mouse/keyboard.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent (OpenGL 3.2+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Supports both keyboard/mouse and controller. Runs great on Steam Deck.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2025 Matthew Burton. All rights reserved. Bearplane™ and Atomic Mills™ are trademarks of Matthew Burton.", "developers": ["Matthew Burton"], "publishers": ["Matthew Burton"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499